    "document": "Event Companion",
    "section": "Event Companion",
    "summary": "Board A of the Singles Event Companion is for Purge the Foe against Disruption. The Purge the Foe player plays Punishment and the Disruption player plays Delaying Action. The app pairs this board with the Search and Destroy deployment. Neither disposition fixes the Attacker or Defender role; a roll-off settles that. Every zone, territory, objective and terrain position comes only from the official board image, and this entry states no measurements. Its lettered terrain pieces refer to the parts of the Battlefields: Armageddon kit.",
